menu "Mote Wand"

    config MOTE_WAND_BOOT_PIN
        string "Four-digit boot access PIN"
        default "0000"
        help
            Exactly four digits used only for the on-device boot access screen.
            This value is intentionally independent from the HID action sequence.

    config MOTE_WAND_ACTION_SEQUENCE
        string "Six-digit HID action sequence"
        default ""
        help
            Six digits sent over the encrypted BLE HID link after an
            AUTH_SEQUENCE match. Leave empty to build with that action disabled.
            Enter is appended automatically. This value is not used by the boot
            access screen and is stored only in the local sdkconfig file, which
            is excluded from Git.

    config MOTE_WAND_GESTURE_RESET_EPOCH
        int "One-shot gesture reset epoch"
        range 0 2147483647
        default 0
        help
            Leave at 0 during normal use. The on-device manager can clear one
            gesture directly. For a bulk development/recovery reset, increase
            this value and flash once. On the first boot for each new value,
            only the gesture model keys are erased; BLE bonds and other NVS
            data are preserved. The applied value is stored in NVS so newly
            recorded gestures are not erased again.

endmenu
